      <Property key="MolecularWeightSeq" value="23.8" />
    </DataNode>
    <DataNode elementId="AT2G31955-MONOMER" textLabel="AT2G31955-MONOMER" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q39055" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="450" centerY="275" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">NIL The cDNA encoding a protein involved in the early steps of molybdenum cofactor biosynthesis (Cnx2) has been isolated from &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt;. The Cnx2, together with a second protein (Cnx3) was able to rescue &lt;i&gt;E. coli&lt;/i&gt; mutants that have been unable to grow on nitrogen medium under anaerobic conditions because of lacking nitrate reductase activity |CITS: [7890743]|. It has been found that Cnx2 has strong sequence similarity to the &lt;i&gt;E. coli&lt;/i&gt; gene moaA that is known to be involved in the early steps of the molybdenum cofactor biosynthesis in this bacterium |CITS: [8514782]|. Cnx2 is expressed in all tissues, and especially strong in the roots of Arabidopsis. The N-terminal extension found in the enzyme supports a possible location of the enzyme in either chloroplasts or mitochondria. Cnx2, as its counterpart MOCS1A in humans, belongs to a superfamily of S-adenosylmethionine-dependent radical enzymes that catalyze the formation of protein and/or substrate radicals by reductive cleavage of SAM by a [4Fe-4S] cluster |CITS: [15180982]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT2G31955-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Araport" value="AT2G31955.1" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pid" value="CAA88107" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Uniprot" value="Q39055" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-13246" />
      <Property key="Accession1" value="AT2G31955.1" />
      <Property key="Gene" value="AT2G31955" />
      <Property key="InstanceNameTemplate" value="MONOMER-*" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_8514782" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_7890743" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_15180982" />
    </DataNode>
